Hi Alchiba,

Try:

df1$chr <- factor(df1$chr, levels = c(as.character(1:22), "X", "Y", "MT"))
ggplot(df1, aes(chr, count)) + geom_bar(stat = "identity")

Best wishes,
Ron.

